<%# One grader's inline grade column cell — the desktop <td> wrapper around the shared
    grade controls. Used identically for an activity row and an action row (only the POST
    endpoint + data-test namespace differ). aa-collapsible so it hides behind the mobile
    "more" toggle, where the same controls re-render interactively. @click.stop keeps the
    controls from toggling the activity's expand. Locals: kind (:activity | :action),
    target, grader ("alex" | "mcr"), grade (ActionGrade | nil). %>
<% test_pref = kind == :activity ? "aa-activity" : "aa-action" %>
<td class="aa-gradecell aa-collapsible" data-test="<%= test_pref %>-grade-<%= grader %>" @click.stop>
  <%= render "agents/activities_grade_controls", kind: kind, target: target, grader: grader,
        grade: grade, test_pref: test_pref %>
</td>
